Date: Sun, 8 Nov 2026 03:43:38 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 10/10] extension file naming: files renamed to the extended
 type's own name or the 'T where <clause>' shape (renames only; Linux x86_64,
 Swift 6.4.2) (coenttb/work#242)

---
 ... CPU.Cache.Padded where T is ~Copyable & Swift.Sendable.swift} | 0
 Sources/CPU/{Swift.Int+CPU.swift => Swift.Int.swift}              | 0
 2 files changed, 0 insertions(+), 0 deletions(-)
 rename Sources/CPU/{CPU.Cache.Padded+Swift.Sendable.swift => CPU.Cache.Padded where T is ~Copyable & Swift.Sendable.swift} (100%)
 rename Sources/CPU/{Swift.Int+CPU.swift => Swift.Int.swift} (100%)

diff --git a/Sources/CPU/CPU.Cache.Padded+Swift.Sendable.swift b/Sources/CPU/CPU.Cache.Padded where T is ~Copyable & Swift.Sendable.swift
similarity index 100%
rename from Sources/CPU/CPU.Cache.Padded+Swift.Sendable.swift
rename to Sources/CPU/CPU.Cache.Padded where T is ~Copyable & Swift.Sendable.swift
diff --git a/Sources/CPU/Swift.Int+CPU.swift b/Sources/CPU/Swift.Int.swift
similarity index 100%
rename from Sources/CPU/Swift.Int+CPU.swift
rename to Sources/CPU/Swift.Int.swift
